WEBVTT

00:00:01.312 --> 00:00:04.834
Run for Your Life by Stephen Waller.

00:00:04.894 --> 00:00:07.976
Penguin readers level one.

00:00:08.036 --> 00:00:15.030
The big street with its cafes and shops and people was behind them now.

00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:17.482
They walked slowly.

00:00:17.542 --> 00:00:19.804
It was quiet.

00:00:19.864 --> 00:00:25.928
Away from the cars and the noise, Kim was excited.

00:00:25.988 --> 00:00:29.684
She held onto Dave's hand.

00:00:29.744 --> 00:00:36.402
They were in a narrow street of tall houses and small shops.

00:00:36.462 --> 00:00:43.506
They heard a radio through an open window, a woman singing.

00:00:43.566 --> 00:00:50.480
Kim stopped and listened, but she did not understand the words.

00:00:50.540 --> 00:00:56.390
Her Spanish was good, but not very good.

00:00:56.450 --> 00:01:02.552
It was the fourth day of their stay in Barcelona.

00:01:02.612 --> 00:01:06.436
Kim and Dave were 17.

00:01:06.496 --> 00:01:14.921
They had the same Spanish teacher at school in Liverpool, a big town in England.

00:01:14.981 --> 00:01:18.584
Do you want to talk Spanish?

00:01:18.644 --> 00:01:24.844
Their teacher said, well, go to Spain.

00:01:24.904 --> 00:01:30.732
There were eight of them from the same school on this holiday.

00:01:30.792 --> 00:01:36.404
They went to school every morning and talked Spanish.

00:01:36.464 --> 00:01:45.926
Then, in the afternoons, they usually went out by bus and saw something in Barcelona.

00:01:45.986 --> 00:01:57.437
Important buildings, famous pictures, old photographs, something new every day.

00:01:57.497 --> 00:02:03.950
Today, Kim and Dave were not with their school friends.

00:02:04.011 --> 00:02:08.824
Dave did not want to go by bus.

00:02:08.884 --> 00:02:25.092
He wanted to look around the old town, not the famous buildings, not the big shopping streets with the banks and cafes and book shops.

00:02:25.152 --> 00:02:32.324
He was interested in the little streets behind the old market.

00:02:32.384 --> 00:02:37.696
The dangerous old town, people said.

00:02:37.756 --> 00:02:41.528
But Dave was not frightened.

00:02:41.588 --> 00:02:46.456
There are dangerous streets in Liverpool too.

00:02:46.516 --> 00:02:55.234
He said, you can't see a town or its people only from a bus.

00:02:55.294 --> 00:02:58.934
It will be exciting.

00:02:58.994 --> 00:03:04.956
They did not try to remember the names of the streets.

00:03:05.016 --> 00:03:08.477
They did not have a street plan.

00:03:08.537 --> 00:03:13.586
At every corner, they stopped and looked.

00:03:13.646 --> 00:03:17.916
Then they came to an interesting little street.

00:03:17.975 --> 00:03:20.658
It was very narrow.

00:03:20.718 --> 00:03:24.151
Very old, they thought.

00:03:24.211 --> 00:03:27.494
Dave took a photograph.

00:03:27.554 --> 00:03:30.226
Kim looked up.

00:03:30.285 --> 00:03:33.958
The houses were very tall.

00:03:34.018 --> 00:03:38.102
The windows up there were in the sun.

00:03:38.162 --> 00:03:42.799
But down in the street, it was dark.

00:03:42.858 --> 00:03:50.374
They came to a little open place with two or three trees and sat down.

00:03:50.433 --> 00:03:52.804
It was quiet.

00:03:52.864 --> 00:03:58.366
Suddenly there was a noise in one of the houses.

00:03:58.426 --> 00:04:06.128
A door opened and a man in a black shirt and jeans ran out.

00:04:06.188 --> 00:04:12.063
He stood at the open door and looked back into the house.

00:04:12.123 --> 00:04:15.910
Then he ran across the street.

00:04:15.970 --> 00:04:19.122
Is he coming over here?

00:04:19.181 --> 00:04:21.204
Kim asked.

00:04:21.263 --> 00:04:25.316
There was something frightening about the man.

00:04:25.376 --> 00:04:28.119
Dave did not answer.

00:04:28.178 --> 00:04:32.562
The man ran to the corner and looked around.

00:04:32.621 --> 00:04:35.323
Then he ran away.

00:04:35.383 --> 00:04:40.202
He put something in that rubbish bin.

00:04:40.261 --> 00:04:43.918
There were shouts from the house.

00:04:43.978 --> 00:04:48.640
A second man ran out into the street.

00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:53.182
He had long hair and dark glasses.

00:04:53.242 --> 00:04:57.464
He stood in the road and looked round.

00:04:57.524 --> 00:05:04.106
Perhaps he's looking for that man in the black shirt, said Dave.

00:05:04.166 --> 00:05:05.857
And look!

00:05:05.917 --> 00:05:08.719
He's got a gun!

00:05:08.779 --> 00:05:11.211
Kim looked.

00:05:11.271 --> 00:05:13.532
Dave was right.

00:05:13.592 --> 00:05:20.476
The long-haired man ran across the street and went round the corner.

00:05:20.536 --> 00:05:24.160
Let's get away from here.

00:05:24.220 --> 00:05:29.362
Kim said, I don't like this.

00:05:29.422 --> 00:05:32.894
But Dave was excited.

00:05:32.954 --> 00:05:37.178
Let's go and have a look in that rubbish bin.

00:05:37.237 --> 00:05:43.206
He said, There was a brown box in the bin.

00:05:43.266 --> 00:05:47.349
Dave took it out and opened it.

00:05:47.409 --> 00:05:51.802
A small white bag fell out.

00:05:51.862 --> 00:05:55.415
Drugs, he said.

00:05:55.474 --> 00:05:59.298
We'll take this to the police.

00:05:59.357 --> 00:06:02.220
Can I see?

00:06:02.280 --> 00:06:08.100
Kim took the little white bag and held it in her hand.

00:06:08.160 --> 00:06:11.960
She was suddenly very frightened.

00:06:12.020 --> 00:06:14.080
She looked round.

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:21.996
Behind them, there was a man, there, under the trees, watching them.

00:06:22.056 --> 00:06:24.508
The man moved.

00:06:24.568 --> 00:06:28.290
Kim looked at the bag in her hand.

00:06:28.350 --> 00:06:30.342
Suddenly she knew.

00:06:30.362 --> 00:06:35.416
Dave, that man, he's back.

00:06:35.475 --> 00:06:38.344
He's here.

00:06:38.404 --> 00:06:43.534
The man was very near them now.

00:06:43.594 --> 00:06:53.068
He was not very tall, with a thin, white face and dark, dangerous eyes.

00:06:53.128 --> 00:06:58.480
Give it to me, he said, in Spanish.

00:06:58.540 --> 00:07:05.594
His frightening eyes moved quickly from Kim to Dave and back to Kim.

00:07:05.654 --> 00:07:07.924
You've got it.

00:07:07.984 --> 00:07:09.888
I saw you.

00:07:09.948 --> 00:07:13.712
Now, give it back.

00:07:13.772 --> 00:07:20.226
Kim opened her mouth, but the words did not come out.

00:07:20.286 --> 00:07:22.688
Oh, Dave?

00:07:22.748 --> 00:07:24.559
She thought.

00:07:24.618 --> 00:07:27.430
Do something.

00:07:27.490 --> 00:07:31.543
But Dave did not move.

00:07:31.603 --> 00:07:35.996
Then she saw the knife in the man's hand.

00:07:36.056 --> 00:07:38.558
She started to run.

00:07:38.618 --> 00:07:43.163
She ran into a small street on the left.

00:07:43.223 --> 00:07:48.176
She ran down two or three narrow streets.

00:07:48.236 --> 00:07:51.930
But she did not see any people.

00:07:51.989 --> 00:07:54.992
She heard him behind her.

00:07:55.052 --> 00:07:58.344
I'll soon find some people.

00:07:58.404 --> 00:08:01.237
Then he won't catch me.

00:08:01.296 --> 00:08:02.868
Quick!

00:08:02.928 --> 00:08:07.210
She thought, I can't stop.

00:08:07.270 --> 00:08:11.202
But all the streets were the same.

00:08:11.261 --> 00:08:14.064
Where was she now?

00:08:14.124 --> 00:08:21.258
Suddenly she came round a corner and her legs went cold.

00:08:21.318 --> 00:08:24.360
The street did not go through.

00:08:24.420 --> 00:08:26.280
It stopped.

00:08:26.340 --> 00:08:37.264
There were some cars and a big old building, an old cinema perhaps, but there was no road through.

00:08:37.323 --> 00:08:39.952
Kim looked back.

00:08:40.011 --> 00:08:44.154
The man stood at the corner and waited.

00:08:44.215 --> 00:08:48.308
He started to walk slowly down the street.

00:08:48.368 --> 00:08:50.910
Kim looked round.

00:08:50.970 --> 00:08:53.732
There was a door in the building.

00:08:53.791 --> 00:08:55.633
She ran to it.

00:08:55.693 --> 00:08:57.414
It opened.

00:08:57.474 --> 00:09:02.098
She went in and shut the door behind her.

00:09:02.158 --> 00:09:06.902
He won't come after me in here.

00:09:06.962 --> 00:09:15.938
people, women, talking, shouting, moving their arms.

00:09:15.998 --> 00:09:26.232
The market, she was in the market in the old town near the big shopping street.

00:09:26.292 --> 00:09:35.038
That door was a back door to the market and the big street was very near.

00:09:35.098 --> 00:09:39.672
She started to walk through the market.

00:09:39.732 --> 00:09:46.464
She was in a slow-moving river of people with heavy shopping bags.

00:09:46.524 --> 00:09:49.826
She moved with the river.

00:09:49.886 --> 00:09:57.948
Every time one person stopped and looked at some fruit or fish, all of them stopped.

00:09:58.008 --> 00:10:04.006
Kim wanted to go quickly, but it was not easy.

00:10:04.066 --> 00:10:09.487
All these women with bags of food for the family.

00:10:09.547 --> 00:10:20.596
Then, in a sea of faces, Kim saw those same dark eyes again, watching her.

00:10:20.656 --> 00:10:24.540
He was here in the market.

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:27.402
Kim started to run.

00:10:27.462 --> 00:10:30.824
There were shopping bags under her feet.

00:10:30.884 --> 00:10:34.542
She fell and got up again.

00:10:34.602 --> 00:10:37.738
people shouted at her.

00:10:37.798 --> 00:10:44.150
One woman tried to catch hold of her, but Kim did not stop.

00:10:44.209 --> 00:10:46.670
Then she looked back.

00:10:46.730 --> 00:10:51.252
The man was not behind her now.

00:10:51.312 --> 00:10:54.012
Perhaps she was wrong.

00:10:54.072 --> 00:10:55.993
Those eyes.

00:10:56.053 --> 00:10:59.391
Perhaps it was not the same man.

00:10:59.451 --> 00:11:02.930
She saw the big street now.

00:11:02.990 --> 00:11:06.954
She saw the sun and the trees.

00:11:07.014 --> 00:11:12.940
Suddenly a hand came down on her arm and held on to her.

00:11:12.960 --> 00:11:16.935
"'Are you Kim Steel?"

00:11:16.994 --> 00:11:19.266
the woman asked.

00:11:19.326 --> 00:11:23.020
She was tall, about thirty.

00:11:23.080 --> 00:11:26.784
She had a friendly look.

00:11:26.844 --> 00:11:31.198
Kim did not understand.

00:11:31.257 --> 00:11:34.892
Yes, she started to say.

00:11:34.952 --> 00:11:37.274
But how do you?

00:11:37.334 --> 00:11:47.584
Then, in the woman's hand, she saw a photo, and in Spanish, the word police.

00:11:47.644 --> 00:11:54.212
I'm Inspector Lothano, but please call me Anna.

00:11:54.272 --> 00:11:57.544
The police woman smiled.

00:11:57.604 --> 00:12:00.926
Your friend Dave found us.

00:12:00.986 --> 00:12:03.336
He's in the car.

00:12:03.396 --> 00:12:05.776
Come with me.

00:12:05.836 --> 00:12:09.648
Kim sat in the car with Dave.

00:12:09.708 --> 00:12:12.658
There was a man with Anna.

00:12:12.718 --> 00:12:17.280
He had long hair and dark glasses.

00:12:17.340 --> 00:12:20.150
Now Kim understood.

00:12:20.170 --> 00:12:24.396
He was a policeman too.

00:12:24.456 --> 00:12:31.682
She gave Anna the little white bag and asked about the man with the knife.

00:12:31.742 --> 00:12:34.064
He sells drugs.

00:12:34.124 --> 00:12:36.134
Is that it?

00:12:36.194 --> 00:12:40.026
That's right, Anna said.

00:12:40.086 --> 00:12:43.398
She looked at the long-haired man.

00:12:43.458 --> 00:12:48.240
Natur here, nearly caught him in his house.

00:12:48.300 --> 00:12:50.220
You saw that.

00:12:50.280 --> 00:12:55.086
Vidal, that's his name, was lucky.

00:12:55.146 --> 00:13:03.904
He got away, but we want him, and you can do something for us.

00:13:03.964 --> 00:13:07.164
Nacho smiled.

00:13:07.224 --> 00:13:20.860
Yes, Kim said slowly, but Vidal knows you now, Kim, and he wants his drugs.

00:13:20.921 --> 00:13:25.488
Listen, this is my plan.

00:13:25.548 --> 00:13:30.596
You go back to that place near Vidal's house.

00:13:30.656 --> 00:13:35.450
Vidal will be there and he'll see you.

00:13:35.510 --> 00:13:38.072
Will be there too.

00:13:38.132 --> 00:13:41.526
But Vidal won't see us.

00:13:41.586 --> 00:13:45.239
He'll think she's looking for her friend.

00:13:45.259 --> 00:13:49.042
I can't do it.

00:13:49.102 --> 00:13:51.694
Don't be frightened.

00:13:51.754 --> 00:13:55.016
Vidal won't get near you.

00:13:55.076 --> 00:13:58.968
We'll stop him, but he'll try.

00:13:58.988 --> 00:14:04.652
And then we'll catch him.

00:14:04.712 --> 00:14:08.436
What do you think, Dave?

00:14:08.496 --> 00:14:10.918
Say something.

00:14:10.978 --> 00:14:21.316
Well, uh, Anna and Natural will be near, and they know all about these things.

00:14:21.376 --> 00:14:23.960
But this for down, man.

00:14:24.020 --> 00:14:25.922
He's got a knife.

00:14:25.982 --> 00:14:29.004
Perhaps he'll kill me?

00:14:29.064 --> 00:14:34.536
Well, yes, but I'll be there too, you know.

00:14:34.556 --> 00:14:37.337
You do it then.

00:14:37.357 --> 00:14:43.808
Ah, but Vidal doesn't know me.

00:14:43.868 --> 00:14:50.758
Kim said yes, and Nacho talked on the car radio.

00:14:50.818 --> 00:14:55.137
Then they drove round behind the market.

00:14:55.197 --> 00:14:59.978
Kim got out and shut the car door.

00:15:00.038 --> 00:15:02.809
She walked to the corner.

00:15:02.869 --> 00:15:05.670
Then she looked back.

00:15:05.730 --> 00:15:08.740
Anna smiled at her.

00:15:08.800 --> 00:15:12.701
Dave's face was very white.

00:15:12.761 --> 00:15:15.242
Kim was frightened.

00:15:15.302 --> 00:15:19.072
These things were exciting in the cinema.

00:15:19.132 --> 00:15:21.908
This was not a game.

00:15:21.968 --> 00:15:24.804
Anna and Nacho were there.

00:15:24.864 --> 00:15:26.856
She knew that.

00:15:26.916 --> 00:15:30.138
But this Vidal was clever.

00:15:30.198 --> 00:15:33.911
Perhaps he knew about their little plan.

00:15:33.972 --> 00:15:37.184
And he was dangerous.

00:15:37.244 --> 00:15:41.218
She was back in the same street now.

00:15:41.278 --> 00:15:43.478
There was the house.

00:15:43.538 --> 00:15:45.991
The door was shut.

00:15:46.051 --> 00:15:49.151
And there was the rubbish bin.

00:15:49.211 --> 00:15:53.832
Two or three people came down the street.

00:15:53.892 --> 00:15:57.484
Kim walked slowly across the road.

00:15:57.544 --> 00:16:03.158
She looked round, then up at the windows of the houses.

00:16:03.218 --> 00:16:05.530
She waited.

00:16:05.590 --> 00:16:07.972
He's here.

00:16:08.032 --> 00:16:09.803
He's watching me.

00:16:09.823 --> 00:16:13.306
I can feel it.

00:16:13.366 --> 00:16:16.081
Then she saw him.

00:16:16.141 --> 00:16:18.036
The black shirt.

00:16:18.096 --> 00:16:20.276
The thin face.

00:16:20.336 --> 00:16:22.548
Those eyes.

00:16:22.608 --> 00:16:24.658
It was Vidal.

00:16:24.718 --> 00:16:27.610
He was very near her.

00:16:27.670 --> 00:16:30.820
Kim looked across the street.

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:33.412
She was ready to run.

00:16:33.472 --> 00:16:36.253
Then she heard Vidal.

00:16:36.313 --> 00:16:38.364
He said something.

00:16:38.424 --> 00:16:43.396
The same thing again and again.

00:16:43.456 --> 00:16:46.493
What's he saying?

00:16:46.553 --> 00:16:48.320
Kim thought.

00:16:48.380 --> 00:16:51.381
Is he talking to me?

00:16:51.441 --> 00:16:53.862
She looked at him.

00:16:53.922 --> 00:16:56.103
He did not move.

00:16:56.163 --> 00:16:58.984
Only his mouth moved.

00:16:59.044 --> 00:17:03.856
This time she understood the words.

00:17:03.916 --> 00:17:06.067
Give it to me.

00:17:06.087 --> 00:17:08.819
Or you're dead.

00:17:08.878 --> 00:17:10.860
He said.

00:17:10.920 --> 00:17:16.748
A car drove round the corner very quickly and stopped.

00:17:16.808 --> 00:17:20.514
Anna and Nacho jumped out.

00:17:20.574 --> 00:17:22.855
They held guns.

00:17:22.915 --> 00:17:25.136
Anna shouted.

00:17:25.196 --> 00:17:28.777
Police, don't move.

00:17:28.837 --> 00:17:31.688
We've got guns.

00:17:31.748 --> 00:17:37.570
Adal suddenly jumped at Kim and caught her.

00:17:37.630 --> 00:17:45.022
Kim tried to hit him to get away, but he held onto her hair.

00:17:45.082 --> 00:17:46.806
He was thin.

00:17:46.866 --> 00:17:48.770
But strong.

00:17:48.830 --> 00:17:51.811
Then she saw the knife.

00:17:51.871 --> 00:17:54.182
You'll be sorry, Vidal.

00:17:54.202 --> 00:17:56.682
Nacho shouted.

00:17:56.742 --> 00:17:59.233
You can't get out of here.

00:17:59.293 --> 00:18:01.284
Think, man.

00:18:01.344 --> 00:18:07.285
Throw the knife down and take your hands from the girl.

00:18:07.345 --> 00:18:11.546
But Vidal held on to Kim.

00:18:11.606 --> 00:18:14.444
He shouted to the police.

00:18:14.504 --> 00:18:17.734
Get back in the car!

00:18:17.794 --> 00:18:20.316
Or I'll do it!"

00:18:20.376 --> 00:18:24.748
He held the knife near Kim's face.

00:18:24.808 --> 00:18:27.340
She shot her eyes.

00:18:27.400 --> 00:18:31.342
Time moved very slowly.

00:18:31.402 --> 00:18:37.504
She saw a face at the window of one of the houses across the road.

00:18:37.564 --> 00:18:42.186
Anna and Nacho moved back to the car.

00:18:42.246 --> 00:18:48.018
Their guns were ready, but Vidal stood behind Kim.

00:18:48.078 --> 00:18:51.680
You're coming with me.

00:18:51.740 --> 00:18:58.314
Suddenly, there were excited shouts from behind the police car.

00:18:58.375 --> 00:19:00.546
It was Dave.

00:19:00.606 --> 00:19:03.878
He ran across the street.

00:19:03.938 --> 00:19:06.599
What's he doing?

00:19:06.659 --> 00:19:08.373
Kim thought.

00:19:08.433 --> 00:19:13.288
Does he want to see me dead?

00:19:13.348 --> 00:19:18.202
Anna tried to stop him.

00:19:18.262 --> 00:19:20.292
Come back!

00:19:20.352 --> 00:19:25.876
This man is dangerous, she shouted.

00:19:25.936 --> 00:19:29.448
Dave ran to the rubbish bin.

00:19:29.508 --> 00:19:37.082
He stopped, took the bin in his hands and held it up over his head.

00:19:37.142 --> 00:19:40.104
Then he threw it.

00:19:40.164 --> 00:19:47.256
The rubbish bin went over Kim's head and hit Vidal.

00:19:47.316 --> 00:19:50.868
Rubbish fell round his feet.

00:19:50.928 --> 00:19:53.088
He fell.

00:19:53.148 --> 00:19:59.162
Kim quickly took the knife from his hand and threw it away.

00:19:59.222 --> 00:20:02.313
There were excited shouts.

00:20:02.373 --> 00:20:04.664
Kim looked up.

00:20:04.724 --> 00:20:07.958
It was Anna and Nacho.

00:20:08.018 --> 00:20:13.143
He's all yours now," said Dave.

00:20:13.203 --> 00:20:19.827
Nacho held Vidal's hands behind his back and took him away.

00:20:19.888 --> 00:20:23.881
Kim fell into Anna's arms.

00:20:23.941 --> 00:20:30.106
Later, they drove back to the hotel in a police car.

00:20:30.166 --> 00:20:33.158
Kim looked at Dave.

00:20:33.218 --> 00:20:35.730
Don't say it.

00:20:35.789 --> 00:20:37.520
I know.

00:20:37.580 --> 00:20:40.212
It was dangerous.

00:20:40.272 --> 00:20:49.228
But I saw the bin and I thought, well, you know, I wanted to do something.

00:20:49.288 --> 00:20:52.712
I see these things in the cinema.

00:20:52.772 --> 00:20:56.074
There's always a strong man.

00:20:56.134 --> 00:21:00.767
Today, I was the strong man.

00:21:00.827 --> 00:21:02.692
Yes?

00:21:02.752 --> 00:21:07.116
And I was nearly the dead girlfriend.

00:21:07.176 --> 00:21:12.118
You see a lot of them in the cinema too?

00:21:12.178 --> 00:21:15.948
Let's not think about it, Dave.

00:21:16.008 --> 00:21:19.220
It's not important now.

00:21:19.279 --> 00:21:25.501
The important thing now is, what are we doing tomorrow?

00:21:25.561 --> 00:21:29.839
We didn't see all of the old town today.

00:21:29.899 --> 00:21:33.870
Let's go out again tomorrow afternoon.

00:21:33.930 --> 00:21:36.453
Have a walk around.

00:21:36.513 --> 00:21:42.110
You can't see a town, only from a bus, you know.

00:21:42.171 --> 00:21:45.435
I'll go for a walk with you tomorrow.

00:21:45.455 --> 00:21:48.058
To the bus stop.

